# Vercel serves only the marketing site (project "wake" → trywake.org has its
# Root Directory set to `site`), but `vercel` uploads from the repo root. Keep
# the app source and the large untracked screenshots/recordings in the repo
# root out of every deploy. Patterns are root-anchored (leading slash) so
# site/'s own PNGs (favicon, og, icons) are never caught.
/node_modules
/.expo
/ios
/android
/assets
/src
/supabase
/docs
/legal
/plugins
/scripts
/*.png
/*.PNG
/*.mp4
/*.md
/.env*
/package-lock.json
